Description: full-featured Jabber/XMPP client
 Vacuum-IM is a cross-platform Jabber/XMPP client built from plugins.
 It supports multiple accounts, nested roster groups, meta-contacts,
 multi-user chat with bookmarks, local and server-side message history,
 file transfer, spell checking and voice calls.
